Description: Querencia Desktop session (alpha)
 Session starter and labwc configuration of Querencia Desktop, a classic
 desktop in the style of GNOME 2 / Ubuntu 10.04 for Wayland.
 .
 Installs "Querencia Desktop" as a Wayland session for display managers
 (/usr/share/wayland-sessions) and the session configuration in
 /etc/querencia/labwc. The session starts, when installed, the polkit agent
 and idle lock (querencia-sitzung), the notification service and the saved
 display layout (querencia-einstellungen). It brings the portal
 configuration of the session (xdg-desktop-portal-gtk) and appearance
 defaults that apply only in the Querencia session: theme
 Querencia-Klassisch, icon theme Querencia, DejaVu fonts and the DMZ-White
 cursor. No display manager is installed, enabled or reconfigured, and
 nothing in home directories is changed.
 .
 Needs labwc 0.9.4 or newer (Ubuntu 26.04 ships 0.9.3, whose menus get
 no keyboard focus; the Querencia APT repository provides a backport).
 This is an alpha release.
